  "title": "Chapter 9: Chemical Reactions",
  "order": 9,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qfrwdy6",
      "content": "Chemical reactions are processes in which substances undergo chemical changes to form new substances with different properties. During a chemical reaction, atoms rearrange themselves to form new molecules. Chemical reactions are essential in everyday life, industrial processes and biological systems."
    },
    {
      "type": "statStrip",
      "stats": [
